an>\n    </h1>\n  </noscript>\n</div><h2 class=\"bde-heading-22-759 bde-heading\">\nExpertos en registro de huéspedes.<br>\n</h2><div class=\"bde-div-22-761 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-image-22-764 bde-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<figure class=\"breakdance-image breakdance-image--27900\">\n\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-clip\"><a class=\"breakdance-image-link breakdance-image-link--url\" href=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/app-registro-huespedes/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\" data-sub-html=\"\" data-lg-size=\"-\"><img class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/principal_black_es.webp\" width=\"825\" height=\"776\" srcset=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/principal_black_es.webp 825w, https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/principal_black_es-768x722.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 825px) 100vw, 825px\" alt=\"BLACKFRIDAY2025\"></a></div>\n\t</div></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-22-1323 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div id=\"btn_empiezagratis_es\" class=\"bde-button-22-1316 bde-button\">\n    \n                                    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n            \n                    \n            \n            \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <a class=\"breakdance-link button-atom button-atom--custom bde-button__button\" href=\"https://app.checkinscan.com/registro/\" target=\"_self\" data-type=\"url\"  >\n\n    \n        <span class=\"button-atom__text\">¡Empieza ahora <b>Gratis</b>!</span>\n\n        \n        \n                </a>\n\n    \n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-column-22-775 bde-column\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-image-22-780 bde-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<figure class=\"breakdance-image breakdance-image--27900\">\n\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-clip\"><a class=\"breakdance-image-link breakdance-image-link--url\" href=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/app-registro-huespedes/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\" data-sub-html=\"\" data-lg-size=\"-\"><img class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/principal_black_es.webp\" width=\"825\" height=\"776\" srcset=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/principal_black_es.webp 825w, https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/principal_black_es-768x722.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 825px) 100vw, 825px\"></a></div>\n\t</div></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</section><section class=\"bde-section-22-781 bde-section\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"section-container\"><div class=\"bde-div-22-782 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-div-22-783 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"bde-heading-22-784 bde-heading\">\nSoluciones de gestión de check-in para todo tipo de alojamientos<br>\n</h2><div class=\"bde-text-22-785 bde-text\">\nDesde Check-in Scan, nos adaptamos a tus necesidades de gestión y volumen de huéspedes para cualquier tipo de alojamiento.\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-22-786 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-grid-22-787 bde-grid\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<a id=\"btn_hotel\" class=\"bde-container-link-22-788 bde-container-link breakdance-link\" href=\"/soluciones-check-in-para-hoteles/\" target=\"_self\" data-type=\"url\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-div-22-789 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-image-22-790 bde-image\">\n<figure class=\"breakdance-image breakdance-image--6557\">\n\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-clip\"><img class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://www.checkinscan.com/wp-content/uploads/Frame.svg\" width=\"\" height=\"\" alt=\"Check-in hotel\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t</div></figure>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-text-22-791 bde-text\">\nHotel\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</a><a id=\"btn_hostal\" class=\"bde-container-link-22-792 bde-container-lin