s=\"bde-heading-8056-103-8056-1 bde-heading bde-heading-8056-103\">\nMás de 8 millones de Check-ins  enviados a las autoridades\n</h2><div class=\"bde-text-8056-104-8056-1 bde-text bde-text-8056-104\">\nExpertos en registro de huéspedes, ¿a qué esperas?\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-8056-105-8056-1 bde-div bde-div-8056-105\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-code-block-8056-106-8056-1 bde-code-block bde-code-block-8056-106\">\n\n\n\n</div><style>@media (max-width:767px){.breakdance .bde-form-builder-8056-107-8056-1 .breakdance-form{grid-template-columns:unset}.breakdance .bde-form-builder-8056-107-8056-1 .breakdance-form--horizontal{grid-auto-flow:unset}.breakdance .bde-form-builder-8056-107-8056-1 .breakdance-form .breakdance-form-field,.breakdance .bde-form-builder-8056-107-8056-1 .breakdance-form .breakdance-form-stepper{grid-column-start:unset}}</style><div id=\"rgratis_banner_es\" class=\"bde-form-builder-8056-107-8056-1 bde-form-builder bde-form-builder-8056-107\">\n\n\n<form id=\"rgratis_banner_es\" class=\"breakdance-form breakdance-form--horizontal\" data-options=\"{&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;custom&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Registro Gratis - ES&quot;,&quot;ajaxUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.checkinscan.com\\/wp-admin\\/admin-ajax.php&quot;,&quot;clearOnSuccess&quot;:true,&quot;hideOnSuccess&quot;:false,&quot;successMessage&quot;:&quot;The form was submitted successfully.&quot;,&quot;errorMessage&quot;:&quot;Something went wrong.&quot;,&quot;redirect&quot;:false,&quot;redirectUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/app.checkinscan.com\\/registro?utm_source={test}&amp;utm_medium={utm_medium}&amp;utm_campaign={utm_campaign}&amp;user_email={correo_electronico}&quot;,&quot;customJavaScript&quot;:{&quot;js_on_success&quot;:&quot;const url = window.location.search;\\nconst urlParams = new URLSearchParams(url);\\n\\nconst utm_source = urlParams.get(&#039;utm_source&#039;) ? urlParams.get(&#039;utm_source&#039;) : \\&quot;\\&quot;;\\nconst utm_medium = urlParams.get(&